w: To con- se- crate my- self to Thee, O Je- sus Christ, I come.
w: With no re- serve and no de- lay, With all my heart I come.
w: I would serve Thee with all my might; There- fore, to Thee I come.
w: For truth, and right- eous- ness, and Thee, Lord of my life, I come.
w: But dear- er still my faith to hold, For my whole life, I come.
w: And at Thy feet to cast it down, O Mas- ter, Lord, I come.
